de was executed; update behavior was tested with successful apt-get simulated upgrades. The persistent APT/dpkg hold and consistent pre/post-restart results make this a minor evidence limitation rather than an outcome failure.","There is no cluster state to validate because the managed topology contains one standalone node."]}
